  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the artisanal fish value chain in Liberia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the marine artisanal small scale fisheries sector in the 9 coastal counties of Liberia. 3 components: 1) Value Chain Development, facilitating fishermen - primary processors which are majority fishmongers/women - secondary processors linkage to a market; 2) Services (financial and non-financial); 3) Governance, including transparency, traceability, efficiency of the sector</narrative>
  </description>
